  - For a general matrix: `'gesvdj'` (Jacobi method)
  - If :attr:`A` is tall or wide (`m >> n` or `m << n`): `'gesvda'` (Approximate method)

- If :attr:`A` is not well-conditioned or precision is relevant: `'gesvd'` (QR based)

